  "task": {
    "objective": "Transport the three owner-specific cargo items to their assigned bays, then escape. Physical couriers may deliver another owner's cargo, and their rotations can enable or obstruct partners.",
    "natural_termination": "All three couriers have escaped, even with undelivered cargo. If all cargo was delivered as well, the last escape grants a shared completion bonus. Otherwise truncate at 96 steps.",
    "interaction": "Limited-energy control turns rotate all live room occupants and undelivered objects, alter connected passages, and may conflict with other operators. Cargo or couriers occupying a closing passage hold it open. Rewards combine shared, owner and carrier interests.",
    "observation_access": "All room geometry, orientation, control commitments, energy, courier/cargo positions, destinations, gates, interlocks and event flags are public. Policy observations include the exact live tile map. No private state is used in this game."
