  "action_semantics": "Input-state masks are applied. Station requests are aggregated first: unanimous CW or CCW requests execute one turn; opposite signs cancel with no energy cost. Every supporting operator pays one if a turn executes. Contents rotate, passages/interlocks refresh, then compass move attempts resolve with old occupancy measured after rotation. Cargo interactions follow moves; escape is last. Empty-handed inactive couriers have only wait. No-op is always legal.",
